\* The code as it is, with one worker (production: one server process).
\* The repository is added while things run, GitHub lists every PR,
\* and a PR can change in the same second as a PR list read.
\* @...@ values are read from the code by check.sh.
SPECIFICATION Spec
CONSTANTS
    PRs = {1, 2}
    MaxTime = 2
    MaxUpdates = 2
    MaxFails = 1
    MaxHourly = 2
    Workers = 1
    StopInclusive = @StopInclusive@
    AdvanceNeedsAllSaved = @AdvanceNeedsAllSaved@
    TargetedNeverAdvances = @TargetedNeverAdvances@
    SaveRule = @SaveRule@
    CapAtListTime = @CapAtListTime@
    ClockAhead = FALSE
    SameSecondUpdates = TRUE
    WithRepoAdd = TRUE
    WithPageRefresh = FALSE
    PartialListing = FALSE
INVARIANTS TypeOK Converged RawNeverGoesBack
